time: `head` 0.28 s, `room` 0.64 s, a wrist 0.26 s (the table). A request returns pictures of at most @@MAX_CAMERAS@@
cameras while the clock runs (`spec()["timing"]`). Anything more is refused (`ValueError`) and changes nothing.
